# "Whenever Dwalin enters or attacks, put a hone counter on each Equipment you control" (CR 603.2, 122.1j). Turn 3: Dwalin
# enters and both of Bot1's Paradise Mantles get a hone counter; Bot1's Ornithopter (an artifact, not an Equipment) and
# Bot2's Paradise Mantle (an Equipment Bot1 doesn't control) get none, and Dwalin stays 2/1, since an Equipment attached to
# nothing gives no one anything. Turn 5: both Mantles - which say nothing about hone counters - are equipped to Dwalin, and their
# counters add up, making Dwalin 4/1 as the attack trigger waits on the stack; the trigger puts a second counter on each Mantle
# and Dwalin strikes first for 6.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mountain
Paradise Mantle
Paradise Mantle
Dwalin, Weaponmaster
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Paradise Mantle
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Paradise Mantle.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#1.Counters.Hone = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#2.Counters.Hone = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Hone = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Counters.Hone = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#1.Activate(Dwalin, Weaponmaster; Ability: Equip)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#2.Activate(Dwalin, Weaponmaster; Ability: Equip)
Bot1.Attack(Dwalin, Weaponmaster > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Power = 4
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#1.AttachedTo = Dwalin, Weaponmaster
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#1.Counters.Hone = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#2.AttachedTo = Dwalin, Weaponmaster
Bot1.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle#2.Counters.Hone = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Power = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Dwalin, Weaponmaster.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Hone = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Paradise Mantle.Counters.Hone = (absent)
